{"strongs": "H4125", "word": "מ֥וֺאָבִי", "translit": "mo.a.vi", "root": "מו", "morph": "N:N--LG", "pos": "adjective, of a people", "gloss": "Moabitish", "definition": "מ֥וֺאָבִי , מוֺאֲבִיָּה adjective, of a people Moabitish ; — ׳ מ Deut 23:4 + 2 t., מֹאָבִי Ezra 9:1 plural מֹאָבִים Deut 2:11 ׳ מוֺאָב Deut 2:29 feminine singular מוֺאֲבִיָּה Ruth 1:22 + 4 t.; ׳ מֹאֲב Ruth 4:10 מוֺאָבִית 2Chr 24:26 feminine plural מוֺאֲבִיּוֺת 1Kgs 11:1 ; Neh 13:23 ׳ מֹאֲב Ruth 1:4 : — masculine = a Moabite Deut 23:4 ; Neh 13:1 ׳ הַמ = the Moabite 1Chr 11:46 collective = the Moabites Ezra 9:1 , so plural Deut 2:11 ; Deut 2:29 feminine plural as adjective ׳ נָשִׁים מ Ruth 1:4 as substantive, 1Kgs 11:1 ; Neh 13:23 feminine singular as adjective 2Chr 24:26 especially ׳ רוּת הַמ Ruth 1:22 ; Ruth 2:2 ; Ruth 2:21 ; Ruth 4:5 ; Ruth 4:10 ׳ מ as noun feminine singular Ruth 2:6 . מוֺאל see מול . [ מוֺבָא ] see מָבוֺא below בוא .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4537')\">BDB4537</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H4125')\">H4125</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4536')\">BDB4536</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4538')\">BDB4538</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>מ֥וֺאָבִי</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>מוֺאֲבִיָּה</bdbheb> <b>adjective, of a people</b> <highlightword>Moabitish</highlightword>; — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 23:4\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(5,23,4)\">Deut 23:4</ref> + 2 t., <bdbheb>מֹאָבִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezra 9:1\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(15,9,1)\">Ezra 9:1</ref> plural <bdbheb>מֹאָבִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 2:11\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(5,2,11)\">Deut 2:11</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מוֺאָב</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 2:29\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(5,2,29)\">Deut 2:29</ref> feminine singular <bdbheb>מוֺאֲבִיָּה</b